        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "There is an exported [`list_paths()`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/608e15779f3d672d30c8ee01ad8ff9cac9f7d723/doc/mini-visits.txt#L542) specifically for users/plugins to programmatically get an array of visited paths in an appropriate order. This seems to be the best common ground for enabling any kind of \"select from recent paths\" functionality which 'mini.visits' itself does not provide.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
